<div class="side-panel">
    <h2 class="side-panel-title"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb"></i> @L["Writing guide"]</h2>
    <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0">
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>@L["Headline"]</strong><br />@L["5 to 200 characters. Put the main keyword near the start."]</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>@L["Summary"]</strong><br />@L["10 to 500 characters. Used in listings, search results and social shares."]</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>@L["Content"]</strong><br />@L["Separate paragraphs with an empty line. HTML is not rendered."]</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>@L["Language"]</strong><br />@L["Choose the language the story is written in. It appears on that language's edition of the site."]</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>@L["Image"]</strong><br />@L["Put the file in wwwroot/images/articles/. A 1200 × 630 image looks best when shared."]</li>
        <li><strong>@L["Review"]</strong><br />@L["Admins approve or return articles with a note. You can edit drafts, pending and rejected articles."]</li>
    </ul>
</div>
